{"publicId":"b973a034-7263-446a-a5c8-6563565b4ff9","title":"英国萨菲尔德大学确认亚马逊雨林两种新吼猴物种及河流屏障作用","status":"watching","reportCount":1,"sourceCount":1,"firstReportAt":"2026-11-10T20:30:01.000Z","latestAt":"2026-11-10T20:30:01.000Z","digest":"英国萨菲尔德大学确认亚马逊雨林存在两种新吼猴物种（Alouatta iroi和Alouatta matogrossensis），并称河流是物种分化的主要地理屏障。\n\n这是继1941年英国剑桥大学发现吼猴新物种后，时隔85年再次确认新吼猴物种。研究基于实地考察和基因分析，发表于《Communications Biology》期刊，但未披露具体样本量、终点定义或人群范围。\n\n早先有研究提出河流可能影响物种分布（2018年《Nature》子刊），但未明确区分吼猴物种。此次发现通过基因比对和地理标记验证了河流的屏障作用。","digestUpdatedAt":"2026-11-10T20:54:25.902Z","summary":null,"excerpt":null,"latest":"英国萨菲尔德大学发现亚马逊雨林两种新猴种，时隔85年","latestReport":{"id":"qjhosnte1kfjb5xzifelpozfg"},"whyHot":{"participants48h":1,"newParticipants6h":0,"recentReports24h":0,"observationComplete":true,"rank":null},"developments":[{"factId":"filM1iaDB3wM","title":"发现两个新种吼猴","firstReportAt":"2026-11-10T20:30:01.000Z","reportCount":1,"representative":{"id":"qjhosnte1kfjb5xzifelpozfg","title":"英国萨菲尔德大学发现亚马逊雨林两种新猴种，时隔85年","summary":"英国萨菲尔德大学团队在《Communications Biology》发表研究，确认亚马逊雨林存在两种新吼猴物种（Alouatta iroi和Alouatta matogrossensis），并揭示河流对物种分化的屏障作用。","source":{"name":"Phys.org","firstParty":false},"publishedAt":"2026-11-10T20:30:01.000Z","selected":false}}],"officialReports":[],"timeline":[{"id":"qjhosnte1kfjb5xzifelpozfg","title":"英国萨菲尔德大学发现亚马逊雨林两种新猴种，时隔85年","summary":"英国萨菲尔德大学团队在《Communications Biology》发表研究，确认亚马逊雨林存在两种新吼猴物种（Alouatta iroi和Alouatta matogrossensis），并揭示河流对物种分化的屏障作用。","source":{"name":"Phys.org","firstParty":false},"publishedAt":"2026-11-10T20:30:01.000Z","selected":false}],"heat":[{"hour":"2026-11-10T21:00:00.000Z","heat":9.9,"participants":1},{"hour":"2026-11-10T22:00:00.000Z","heat":9.6,"participants":1},{"hour":"2026-11-10T23:00:00.000Z","heat":9.3,"participants":1},{"hour":"2026-11-11T01:00:00.000Z","heat":8.8,"participants":1},{"hour":"2026-11-11T02:00:00.000Z","heat":8.5,"participants":1},{"hour":"2026-11-11T03:00:00.000Z","heat":8.3,"participants":1},{"hour":"2026-11-11T04:00:00.000Z","heat":8.1,"particip